      *COMPILE LIST
      *PROCEDURE
            CALL (EMPLOYEE.NUMBER)     EMPLOYNO,
                 (BONDEDUCTION)        BONDEDUCT,
                 (BONDENOMINATION)     BONDENOM,
                 (BONDACCUMULATION)    BONDACCUM,
                 (INSURANCE.PREM)      INSPREM,
                 (RETIREMENT.PREM)     RETPREM,
                 (DEPARTMENT.TOTAL)    DPT.
      START.  OPEN ALL FILES.
      GET.MASTER.  GET MASTER, AT END DO END.OF.MASTERS.
      GET.DETAIL.  GET DETAIL, AT END GO TO END.OF.DETAILS.
      COMPARE.EMPLOYEE.NUMBERS.  GO TO COMPUTE.PAY WHEN DETAIL EMPLOYNO
            IS EQUAL TO MASTER EMPLOYNO, LOW.DETAIL WHEN DETAIL
            EMPLOYNO IS LESS THAN MASTER EMPLOYNO.
      HIGH.DETAIL.  MOVE 'M' TO MASTER ERRORCODE, FILE MASTER IN
            ERROR.FILE.
              GET MASTER, AT END DO END.OF.MASTERS.
              GO TO COMPARE.EMPLOYEE.NUMBERS.
      LOW.DETAIL.  MOVE 'D' TO DETAIL ERRORCODE, FILE DETAIL IN
            ERROR.FILE.
              GO TO GET.DETAIL.
      END.OF.MASTERS.  IF DETAIL EMPLOYNO = HIGH.VALUE THEN GO TO
            END.OF.RUN OTHERWISE SET MASTER EMPLOYNO = HIGH.VALUE.
      END.OF.DETAILS.  IF MASTER EMPLOYNO = HIGH.VALUE THEN GO TO
            END.OF.RUN OTHERWISE SET DETAIL EMPLOYNO = HIGH.VALUE, GO
            TO COMPARE.EMPLOYEE.NUMBERS.
      END.OF.RUN.  MOVE CORRESPONDING GRAND.TOTAL TO PAYRECORD, FILE
            PAYRECORD, CLOSE ALL FILES.
              STOP 1234.
      COMPUTE.PAY.  IF DETAIL HOURS IS GREATER THAN 40 THEN SET DETAIL
            GROSS = (DETAIL HOURS - 40) * MASTER RATE * 1.5.
              SET DETAIL GROSS = DETAIL GROSS + MASTER RATE * 40, DO
            FICA.ROUTINE, DO WITHOLDING.TAX.ROUTINE.
              IF MASTER BONDEDUCT IS NOT EQUAL TO ZERO THEN DO
            BOND.ROUTINE.
              DO SEARCH FOR INDEX = 1(1)12.
      NET.    SET PAYRECORD NETPAY = DETAIL GROSS - DETAIL FICA - DETAIL
            WHT - DETAIL RETIREMENT - DETAIL INSURANCE - DETAIL
            BONDEDUCT.
              ADD CORRESPONDING DETAIL TOTALS TO MASTER TOTALS, MOVE
            CORRESPONDING DETAIL TO PAYRECORD, CHECK, MOVE PAYRECORD
            NETPAY TO CHECK AMOUNT.
              FILE CHECK.
              IF PAYRECORD DEPARTMENT IS GREATER THAN CURRENT DEPARTMENT
            THEN MOVE BLANKS TO PAYRECORD EMPLOYNO, PAYRECORD NAME,
            MOVE CORRESPONDING DEPARTMENT.TOTAL TO PAYRECORD, FILE
            PAYRECORD, MOVE ZEROS TO DPT HOURS, DPT GROSS, DPT WHT,
            DPT FICA, DPT BONDEDUCT, DPT INSPREM, DPT RETPREM, DPT
            NETPAY, DPT BONDPURCHASES.
              MOVE CORRESPONDING DETAIL TO PAYRECORD, CURRENT,  ADD
            CORRESPONDING DETAIL TO DEPARTMENT.TOTAL, GRAND.TOTAL,
            FILE PAYRECORD.
              GO TO GET.MASTER.
      FICA.ROUTINE.  BEGIN SECTION.
              IF MASTER FICA + 0.03 * DETAIL GROSS IS LESS THAN 144.00
            THEN SET DETAIL FICA = 0.03 * DETAIL GROSS  OTHERWISE SET
            DETAIL FICA = 144.00 - MASTER FICA.
              ADD DETAIL FICA TO MASTER FICA.
            END FICA.ROUTINE.
      WITHOLDING.TAX.ROUTINE.  BEGIN SECTION.
              IF 13 * MASTER EXEMPTIONS IS LESS THAN DETAIL GROSS THEN
            SET DETAIL WHT = 0.18 * (DETAIL GROSS - 13 * MASTER
            EXEMPTIONS) OTHERWISE SET DETAIL WHT = ZEROS.
              ADD DETAIL WHT TO MASTER WHT.
            END WITHOLDING.TAX.ROUTINE.
      BOND.ROUTINE.  BEGIN SECTION.
              ADD MASTER BONDEDUCT TO MASTER BONDACCUM.
      BOND.CALCULATION.  IF MASTER BONDENOM IS NOT GREATER THAN MASTER
            BONDACCUM THEN SET MASTER BONDACCUM = MASTER BONDACCUM -
            MASTER BONDENOM OTHERWISE GO TO BOND.END.
              MOVE CORRESPONDING MASTER TO BONDORDER, ADD BONDORDER
            BONDENOM TO DPT BONDPURCHASES, MOVE BONDORDER BONDENOM TO
            PAYRECORD BONDENOM, FILE BONDORDER IN ERROR.FILE.
              GO TO BOND.CALCULATION.
      BOND.END.  END BOND.ROUTINE.
      SEARCH.  BEGIN SECTION.
              IF MASTER RATE GT TABLE.ITEM RATE (INDEX) THEN GO TO
            SEARCH.END OTHERWISE ADD TABLE.ITEM INSPREM (INDEX) TO
            DETAIL INSURANCE, ADD TABLE.ITEM RETPREM (INDEX) TO DETAIL
            RETIREMENT, GO TO NET.
      SEARCH.END.  END SEARCH.
      *DATA
      MASTER           1RECORD      L
       ERRORCODE       2             A
      DATA             2
       EMPLOYEE.NUMBER 3
        DEPARTMENT     4             99
        EMPLOYEE       4             9999
       NAME            3             A(15)
       RATE            3             99V999
       DATE            3
        MONTH          4             99
        DAY            4             99
        YEAR           4             99
       EXEMPTIONS      3             99
       TOTALS          3
        GROSS          4             99999V99
        RETIREMENT     4             999V99
        INSURANCE      4             999V99
       FICA            3             999V99
       WHT             3             9999V99
      BONDEDUCTION     3             99V99
      BONDACCUMULATION 2             999V99
      BONDENOMINATION  2             999V99
                       2             AAA
      DETAIL           1RECORD      L
       ERRORCODE       2             A
       HOURS           2             99V9
      DATA             2
       EMPLOYEE.NUMBER 3
        DEPARTMENT     4             99
        EMPLOYEE       4             9999
       NAME            3             A(15)
       DATE            3
        MONTH          4             99
        DAY            4             99
        YEAR           4             99
       EXEMPTIONS      3             99
       TOTALS          3
        GROSS          4             99999V99
        RETIREMENT     4             999V99
        INSURANCE      4             999V99
       FICA            3             999V99
       WHT             3             9999V99
      BONDEDUCTION     3             99V99
      BONDACCUMULATION 2             999V99
      BONDENOMINATION  2             999V99
                       2             AAAAA
      BONDORDER        1RECORD      L
       EMPLOYEE.NUMBER 2             9(6)
        DATE           2             9(6)
       BONDENOMINATION 2             999V99
        NAME           2             A(15)
      CHECK            1RECORD      L
       EMPLOYEE.NUMBER 2
        DEPARTMENT     3             99
        EMPLOYEE       3             9999
       NAME            2             A(15)
        AMOUNT         2             $***9.99
      PAYRECORD        1RECORD      L
      EMPLOYEE.NUMBER  2
       DEPARTMENT      3             99
                       3             A
       EMPLOYEE        3             9999
                       2             A
      NAME             2             A(15)
      DATE             2
                       3             A
       MONTH           3             99
                       3             A
       DAY             3             99
                       3             A
       YEAR            3             99
      HOURS            2             8889.9-
      GROSS            2             $88889.99-
       WHT             2             $88889.99-
       FICA            2             $8889.99-
       BONDEDUCTION    2             $8889.99-
       INSURANCE       2             $8889.99-
       RETIREMENT      2             $8889.99-
      NETPAY           2             $88889.99-
       BONDENOMINATION 2             $88899.99-
      DEPARTMENT.TOTAL 1RECORD      L
        HOURS          2             9999V9
       GROSS           2             9(5)V99
        WHT            2             9(5)V99
        FICA           2             9999V99
        BONDEDUCTION   2             9999V99
        INSURANCE.PREM 2             9999V99
        RETIREMENT.    2                                               X
                  PREM               9999V99
       NETPAY          2             9(5)V99
        BONDPURCHASES  2             9(5)V99
      GRAND.TOTAL      1COPY         DEPARTMENT.TOTAL
      TABLE            1            L
                       2             '0099908006001499100060'
                       2             '0199912009002499150090'
                       2             '0299915012003499200120'
                       2             '0399920015004499250150'
                       2             '0499930018006499300250'
                       2             '0799930035099999300500'
                       1REDEF        TABLE
      TABLE.ITEM       2         12
       RATE            3             99V999
       INSURANCE.PREM  3             9V99
       RETIREMENT.PREM 3             9V99
      CURRENT          1RECORD
      DEPARTMENT       2             99
      INDEX            2             99
      *FINISH
